      "id": "fs26f7995331c81",
      "slug": "fireside-who-owes-open-source-what",
      "title": "Who owes open source what?",
      "abstract": "<p>What do maintainers, users, companies and sponsors owe one another? Where does each group’s responsibility begin and end, and how does money change those expectations?</p>",
      "format": "Fireside chat",
      "published": true,
