    {
      "id": "fs2674cf818b29b",
      "slug": "fireside-being-a-good-developer",
      "title": "What does being a good developer mean now?",
      "abstract": "<p>If writing code is getting easier, what distinguishes someone good at the job? When “code is cheap,” which skills should we spend more time developing?</p>",
      "format": "Fireside chat",
      "published": true,
      "speakers": [
