    {
      "id": "fs26ef8a9c617d3",
      "slug": "fireside-software-development-complexity",
      "title": "Have we made software development too complicated?",
      "abstract": "<p>Frameworks, infrastructure, abstractions and tooling: which complexity earns its keep, and which have we simply learned to accept? What could we do without?</p>",
      "format": "Fireside chat",
      "published": true,
