    },
    {
      "id": "fs262ce9f31b4f2",
      "slug": "fireside-the-way-into-the-industry",
      "title": "Is the way into this industry broken?",
      "abstract": "<p>Junior jobs, degrees, bootcamps, self-teaching, mentorship and AI: what would starting today look like? Which fundamentals still matter, and how do newcomers get the experience everyone expects them to have?</p>",
      "format": "Fireside chat",
      "published": true,
      "speakers": [
