    },
    {
      "id": "fs263c3cbc9227b",
      "slug": "fireside-choosing-frameworks-with-ai",
      "title": "Would you choose a different framework if AI wrote most of the code?",
      "abstract": "<p>Does boilerplate still matter? Do explicit conventions become more useful than flexibility? Would you choose the framework the model knows best, or the one you can most confidently understand and debug?</p>",
      "format": "Fireside chat",
      "published": true,
      "speakers": [
