      "slug": "fireside-building-our-own-products",
      "title": "Why don’t we build more of our own products?",
      "abstract": "<p>What stops developers from turning their skills into products? Finding customers, money, confidence, time—or simply not wanting the lifestyle that comes with running a business?</p>",
